<title>USA: Wasserstein Perella says North to head Dallas ofc.</title>
<headline>Wasserstein Perella says North to head Dallas ofc.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wasserstein Perella &amp; Co said Tuesday Kerry North joined the company as managing director and head of the Dallas office.</p>
<p>The company said he replaces Nancy Huggins, who is taking another position in the company.</p>
<p>North was previously a corporate partner in the law firm of Baker &amp; Botts LLP in Dallas.</p>
<p>Wasserstein Perella &amp; Co, a unit of Wasserstein Perella Group Inc , is an international investment bank.</p>
</text>
